{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港鐵觀塘綫藍田站路軌旁發生火警，觀塘站來往調景嶺站暫停服務，觀塘站來往黃埔站每4分鐘一班車。由於藍田站現時沒有列車服務，藍田站正關閉。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港鐵表示免費接駁巴士已到達，接載乘客來往觀塘、藍田及油塘站。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.300390+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T10:16:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:41.399629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:41.399629+00:00","content_hash":"d8816830b607b423fc0293d320c1a8c60b6f21fdc39996cca8b76b400d914c60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}